# Optional Profile patch for DSH browser-control tools.
# Merge this insert entry into the active Profile's cordis.patch.yml; do not replace unrelated entries.
# The Profile package.json must list this package as a dependency first.
# The Profile should also include @deepseek-ai/dsh-skill for the model-facing Skill registry/tool.
- insert:
    - id: tool-control-chrome
      name: '@lyd123qw2008/dsh-tool-control-chrome'
